ture Perfect Side Surf","poi_name":"Golden Play Hole","subject":"Unknown","author":"Bob Ellstrom","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/18577","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/18577"}},{"id":"15222","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"5662","description":"Kirk carving a perfect line through Elbow Falls.","caption":"(RM) Kirk at Elbow Falls","poi_name":"Elbow Falls","subject":"Kirk Duchow","author":"Rob Maxwell","poi_id":"355","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/15222","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/15222"}},{"id":"14773","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"2945","description":"rolling up on the goal posts ","caption":"Screaming 1/4 mile rapid","poi_name":"Screaming 1/4 mile","subject":"Craig Irwin and Jarrod Hobson","author":"Kati Irwin","poi_id":"356","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/14773","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/14773"}},{"id":"14772","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"2945","description":"great day on the river\r\n620cfs\r\nall by ourselves\r\n","caption":"Elbow Falls","poi_name":"Elbow Falls","subject":"Hobson and Irwin","author":"Craig Irwin","poi_id":"355","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/14772","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/14772"}},{"id":"14774","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"2945","description":"Picking apart the screaming quarter mile rapid at the Goal Posts rocks.\r\nLanding in the eddy behind the rock allows you to slow things down and enjoy the creek.","caption":"Goal Posts","poi_name":"Screaming 1/4 mile","subject":"Craig Irwin","author":"Kati Irwin","poi_id":"356","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medi